  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that scvi_n200 with multiprofile and avgpool aggregation (config_005) achieves the highest RNA-only accuracy (0.6501). However, multimodal experiments like config_030 (resnet50 + concat) underperform. This experiment tests combining scvi_n200 with a stronger image encoder (imagenet_vit_l) and weighted fusion, isolating the impact of image modality and fusion strategy. It directly addresses whether improved image encoders and fusion methods can surpass the RNA-only baseline, balancing exploration of critical design choices with a logical extension of prior findings."
